  m_Name: AstralPulseUnlockTaleStone
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TaleStoneData
  DialogueLines:
  - textVI: "C\u1EA3 th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi n\xE0y \u0111ang ch\xECm trong m\u1ED9t gi\u1EA5c
      m\u1ED9ng d\xE0i, m\u1ECFi m\xF2n ch\u1EDD \u0111\u1EE3i s\u1EF1 \u0111\xE1nh
      th\u1EE9c."
    textEN: This entire realm slumbers in a long, unbroken dream, yearning to be
      awakened.
    AutoSkip: 0
  - textVI: "H\xE3y m\u1EDF kh\xF3a tr\xE1i tim m\xECnh... Gi\u1EA3i ph\xF3ng v\u1EA7ng
      d\u01B0\u01A1ng thu\u1EA7n khi\u1EBFt \u1EA9n s\xE2u trong linh h\u1ED3n con,
      v\xE0 g\u1ECDi v\u1EA1n v\u1EADt t\u1EC9nh gi\u1EA5c."
    textEN: Unlock your heart... Release the pure sun hidden within your soul, and
      call the world back to life.
    AutoSkip: 0
  AutoProgressDelay: 1.5
  TypingSpeed: 0.05
